epistaxis: carotid cavernous fistula</article-title><source>Emerg Med J</source><year>2007</year><volume>24</volume><fpage>e28</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1136/emj.2006.045195</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17452688</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>